vative electorate not getting off their ass and not understanding that the left will not quit until they are completely eradicated.\n\nWe did not have the same \"too big to rig\" energy we did in '24. Conservative voters have the most documentable case of, \"The Fighters Paradox\" I have ever seen.\n\nDo we address this? No. Let's just start infighting, looking for scapegoats, and do our enemy's jobs for them. Because that is always how to get shit done...Right?...\n\n", "author": "Alpha-Kil0", "created": 1793985579414, "profile_picture": "nFm7nABf3gi8", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Iremembermypassword", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Didn't sign up to work for the left...", "last_comment_created": 1793987395496, "content": "<p>When last I checked I don't work for leftists or give them aid or comfort. And yet, everytime we hit a speed bump, the right turns on itself like a pack of Jackals.</p>\n<p>The fault is two prong. Obvious fraud not checked by the SAVE act, and an almost precisely predictable habit of the Conservative electorate not getting off their ass and not understanding that the left will not quit until they are completely eradicated.</p>\n<p>We did not have the same &quot;too big to rig&quot; energy we did in '24. Conservative voters have the most documentable case of, &quot;The Fighters Paradox&quot; I have ever seen.</p>\n<p>Do we address this? No. Let's just start infighting, looking for scapegoats, and do our enemy's jobs for them. Because that is always how to get shit done...Right?...</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 2, "score_up": 14, "is_edited":